        <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #C9BEA9; margin: 0;">Put the game on your classroom screen. Students join on their own phones and race to answer. The whole class plays at once, and you get the results the moment it ends.</p>
        <ul style="list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5;">
          <li>📱 <strong>Join in seconds:</strong> students scan a QR code or type a game PIN at classcoach.in/play. No app to install.</li>
          <li>⏱️ <strong>You set the pace:</strong> 10 to 60 seconds per question.</li>
          <li>🏆 <strong>Speed counts:</strong> points for every right answer, bonus points for answering fast, and a live leaderboard after each question.</li>
          <li>📊 <strong>Instant results:</strong> every student's score and rank, and which questions the class found hardest.</li>
          <li>💬 <strong>Parents in one tap:</strong> send each parent their child's result and the chapters to practise, on WhatsApp.</li>
          <li>🩺 <strong>NEET &amp; JEE coaches:</strong> start a 5-minute revision game straight from the question bank.</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #A99F8C; margin: 0;">Uses the multiple-choice questions from your tests. Up to 30 players on the free trial, 300 on any paid plan.</p>
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
          <a href="/signup" class="btn btn-primary">Try Live Quiz free</a>
          <a href="/play" style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #FBF6EE; border-bottom: 1px solid #FBF6EE; padding-bottom: 2px;">Student? Join a game →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="flex: 1; min-width: 280px; display: flex; justify-content: center;">
        <div style="width: 100%; max-width: 360px; background: #FBF6EE; color: var(--ink); border-radius: 16px; padding: 22px; box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
            <span style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--faint);">LEADERBOARD · Question 5 of 10</span>
            <span style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent);">PIN 482 913</span>
          </div>
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: 10px; background: #F2C14E; font-weight: 700;"><span>1. Ananya</span><span>4,620</span></div>
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: 10px; background: #EFE6D8; font-weight: 600;"><span>2. Rahul</span><span>4,410</span></div>
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: 10px; background: #EFE6D8; font-weight: 600;"><span>3. Fathima</span><span>3,980</span></div>
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: 10px; background: #EFE6D8;"><span>4. Karthik</span><span>3,700</span></div>
          <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--faint);">24 of 26 students answered · 71% got it right</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- DEMO VIDEO -->
  <div id="demo" style="background: #FFFFFF; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);">
    <div style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 64px 32px; text-align: center;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 28px; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 12px;">See it in action</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 32px;">A 90-second walkthrough — from syllabus to graded results.</p>
      <video
        controls
        preload="none"
        poster="/demo-poster.jpg"
        style="width: 100%; max-width: 800px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--line); box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);"
      >
        <source src="/demo.mp4" type="video/mp4">
        Your browser doesn't support embedded video — <a href="/demo.mp4">download the demo</a> instead.
      </video>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- FEATURES -->
  <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);">
    <div style="max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 72px 32px;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 28px; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 40px;">Everything you need, nothing you don't</h2>
      <div class="grid-2">
        <div class="card" style="padding: 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;">
          <span style="font-size: 20px;">📄</span>
          <h3 style="font-size: 17px;">AI question generation</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">Paste a syllabus or upload a PDF — get chapter-tagged questions in minutes, ready to review.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="padding: 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;">
          <span style="font-size: 20px;">✓</span>
          <h3 style="font-size: 17px;">Automatic evaluation</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">Objective answers are graded the moment a student submits — no marking pile.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="padding: 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;">
          <span style="font-size: 20px;">📊</span>
          <h3 style="font-size: 17px;">Chapter-wise tracking</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">Every result rolls up into a per-student, per-chapter picture — not just a score.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="padding: 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;">
          <span style="font-size: 20px;">💬</span>
          <h3 style="font-size: 17px;">Parent reports</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">Share a result the moment it's graded — a link, an email, or their own parent login.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="padding: 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;">
          <span style="font-size: 20px;">🖥️</span>
          <h3 style="font-size: 17px;">Slides &amp; notes</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">Generate a slide deck or class notes from the same source material, and share them with your class.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="padding: 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;">
          <span style="font-size: 20px;">🖨️</span>
          <h3 style="font-size: 17px;">Printable question papers</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">Download any test as a PDF question paper for offline use, plus a separate answer key for yourself.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
  <div>
    <div style="max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 72px 32px;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 28px; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 40px;">Three steps, start to finish</h2>
      <div class="grid-3">
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
          <span style="font-family: 'Newsreader', serif; font-size: 34px; color: #D8A87C;">01</span>
          <h3 style="font-size: 17px;">Upload your syllabus</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">Paste a chapter outline or upload a PDF — ClassCoach drafts questions by chapter.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
          <span style="font-family: 'Newsreader', serif; font-size: 34px; color: #D8A87C;">02</span>
          <h3 style="font-size: 17px;">Review and publish</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">Edit anything that needs a fix, then publish the test for your class to take on their own phone.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
          <span style="font-family: 'Newsreader', serif; font-size: 34px; color: #D8A87C;">03</span>
          <h3 style="font-size: 17px;">Get results and reports</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">Objective answers grade instantly. You see the weak chapters, and parents get their update.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

